  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Floods Response through Provision of Integrated Water, Sanitation and Hygiene Promotion (WASH) Services in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to provide life-saving support to flood-affected communities through the provision of integrated water, sanitation, and hygiene (WASH) services in Baardhere and Kismayo districts of Jubaland state of Somalia. The project is expected to contribute to the countrywide efforts by the humanitarian actors to alleviate the impact of El Ni&#xf1;o.</narrative>
  </description>
